498	     * Counts how many existing owners share the given first and last name, compared
499	     * case-insensitively. This is evaluated before the new owner is persisted, so the
500	     * owner being created is not included in the count.
501	     *
502	     * @param firstName the new owner's first name
503	     * @param lastName  the new owner's last name
